    "content": "# Chatgpt notion concept \r\n\r\n**Notion ID**: `1923e516-28c2-83a2-a04f-0118292ce353`\r\n\r\n\r\n### Properties\r\n\r\n- **UQg\\**: Chatgpt,Notion,Chatgpt convo\r\n- **dn<P**: ‣\r\n- **lqUb**: No\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n\r\n## Content\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<details><summary><b>Final locked pipeline </b></summary>\r\n\r\n\r\n```Plain Text\r\nChatGPT Export\r\n↓\r\nParser (external / automation)\r\n↓\r\nRaw CSV\r\n↓\r\nGoogle Sheets\r\n↓\r\nChatGPT\r\n    ✓ Canonicalization    ✓ Duplicate Merge    ✓ Aliases    ✓ Categories    ✓ Hierarchy    ✓ Relationships    ✓ Review    ✓ Confidence\r\n↓\r\nProcessed CSV\r\n↓\r\nNotion Import\r\n↓\r\nMaster Concepts Database\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n<details><summary><b>Read</b></summary>\r\n\r\n  ‣ \r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n<details><summary><b>\r\n</b></summary>\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n",
