    "content": "# ☀️ My Notes Main — Complete Architecture & Content Archive\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Source Link**: [My Notes Main](https://app.notion.com/p/My-Notes-main-3f03e51628c280e0ba9ed73757c26c53?source=copy_link)  \n> **Root Notion Page ID**: `3f03e516-28c2-80e0-ba9e-d73757c26c53`  \n> **Local Workspace Folders**: [scratch/my_notes/INDEX.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/INDEX.md) and [my_notes/INDEX.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/my_notes/INDEX.md)  \n> **Extraction Level**: 100% Full Recursive Sync (All toggles, nested blocks, protocols, code blocks, and database entries retrieved).\n\n---\n\n## 1. System Overview & Collections Structure\n\nThe **☀️ My Notes Main** workspace functions as an administrative, technical, philosophical, and personal operational notebook. It is structured around two primary database collections and dashboard toggles:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    Root[\"☀️ My Notes Main (Root Hub)\"] --> AdminToggle[\"My Adminnotes Dashboard\"]\n    Root --> NotesToggle[\"Mynotes Dashboard\"]\n    \n    AdminToggle --> AdminDB[\"My Adminnotes Collection (5963e516...)\"]\n    NotesToggle --> NotesDB[\"Mynotes Collection (dc93e516...)\"]\n    \n    subgraph AdminDB_Items [\"My Adminnotes Entries\"]\n        P1[\"Notion ChatGPT Copy Protocol (OKTP v1.0)\"]\n        P2[\"Chatgpt Notion Concept\"]\n        P3[\"Chatgpt prmp analyse (::AUDIT.MODE:: & Global Prompts)\"]\n        P4[\"Mati Vivek (Dialogue on Power & Shakti)\"]\n        P5[\"Vivarta Vada & Vadas (Causation in Indian Philosophy)\"]\n        P6[\"Uttarkashi UK (Land Due Diligence Protocol)\"]\n        P7[\"Misc Notes\"]\n    end\n    \n    subgraph NotesDB_Items [\"Mynotes Entries\"]\n        T1[\"To do lists Main\"]\n        T2[\"Sample To do lists (1)\"]\n        T3[\"Sample\"]\n    end\n    \n    AdminDB --> AdminDB_Items\n    NotesDB --> NotesDB_Items\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Master Catalog of Extracted Notes & Contents\n\n### 🛠️ Administrative & AI Engineering Protocols\n1. **[02_Notion chatgpt copy protocol.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/02_Notion%20chatgpt%20copy%20protocol.md)** (67 blocks, ~7 KB)\n   - **Om ChatGPT → Notion Export Protocol (OKTP v1.0)**: Strict deterministic rules for converting LLM conversations into Notion assets without summarization or tone alteration.\n   - **Execution Protocol**: Step-by-step export flow, scope gates, heading mapping (H1/H2 → Toggle headings), list formatting, native table priorities, and block preservation.\n2. **[03_Chatgpt notion concept.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/03_Chatgpt%20notion%20concept.md)** (63 blocks)\n   - Core concepts for structuring prompt engineering, conversation caching, and long-term memory integration into Notion databases.\n3. **[05_Chatgpt prmp analyse.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/05_Chatgpt%20prmp%20analyse.md)** (345 blocks, ~56 KB)\n   - **`::AUDIT.MODE::` Framework**: Production-grade verification protocol defining 15 audit gates (Context Reconstruction, Clarification Gate, Source Hierarchy, Input Validation, Calculation Audit, Contradiction Audit, Inference Audit, and Risk Audit).\n   - **Global Custom Instructions**: Deep prompt guidelines, error classification taxonomies (`DATA_ERROR`, `CALCULATION_ERROR`, `SOURCE_ERROR`, `LOGICAL_ERROR`, `ASSUMPTION_ERROR`, etc.), and strict output structures.\n\n---\n\n### 🕉️ Philosophy, Metaphysics & Indian Epistemology\n4. **[04_Mati vivek.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/04_Mati%20vivek.md)** (72 blocks, 1,459 lines, ~114 KB)\n   - **\"शक्ति — वास्तविक शक्ति क्या है? मति और विवेक के बीच एक संवाद\"**:\n   - Extensive philosophical dialogue examining the essence of *Śakti* (capacity to effect change), control vs. discernment, desire, action, spiritual practice (*sadhana*), human motivation, and the nature of the mind (*Mati*) guided by higher intelligence (*Vivek*).\n5. **[06_Vivarta vada and vadas.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/06_Vivarta%20vada%20and%20vadas.md)** (328 blocks, 416 lines, ~45 KB)\n   - **Grand Classification of Causation (*Kārya-Kāraṇa Vāda*) in Indian Philosophy**:\n   - Comprehensive study of causality across classical Darshanas:\n     - **Satkāryavāda** (Effect pre-exists in cause) vs. **Asatkāryavāda** (Effect is new manifestation).\n     - **Vivartavāda** (Advaita Vedanta's doctrine of apparent illusory transformation — *the rope and the snake* analogy, *Brahman* and *Jagat*).\n     - **Pariṇāmavāda** (Samkhya's real transformation — *milk to curd*).\n     - Comparisons with Nyaya-Vaisheshika, Buddhist *Pratītyasamutpāda*, and Jain causality.\n\n---\n\n### 🏞️ Real Estate & Due Diligence\n6. **[07_Uttarkashi UK.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/07_Uttarkashi%20UK.md)** (693 blocks, 2,025 lines, ~48 KB)\n   - **::UTTARKASHI.LAND.DUE.DILIGENCE.PROTOCOL::**:\n   - Master checklist for acquiring land in Uttarkashi, Uttarakhand:\n     - **Property Identity**: Tehsil, Revenue Village, Patwari Circle, Khata/Khasra/Gata numbers.\n     - **Title & Ownership**: 30-year search, Bhumidhari rights (ZALR Act), encumbrance certificate, non-tribal clearance (Section 157-A).\n     - **State Land Laws**: Uttarakhand Land Laws (250 sq meter ceiling for outsiders, agricultural land restrictions).\n     - **Environmental & Zoning Constraints**: Bhagirathi Eco-Sensitive Zone (ESZ), forest boundary buffers, flood zones, landslide susceptibility.\n     - **Mutation & Construction Permissions**: 143 conversion from agricultural to non-agricultural, tin shed / semi-permanent structures legalities, road access easements.\n\n---\n\n### 📋 Productivity, Tasks & General Research\n7. **[08_Misc Notes.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/08_Misc%20Notes.md)** (178 blocks, ~61 KB)\n   - Extended research clips, reference material, working ideas, and thoughts.\n8. **[09_To do lists Main.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/09_To%20do%20lists%20Main.md)** (116 blocks)\n   - Master actionable to-do lists, task groupings, checklist items, and workflow queues.\n9. **[10_Sample To do lists 1.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/10_Sample%20To%20do%20lists%201.md)** (90 blocks)\n   - Structured checklist template and sample task flow.\n10. **[11_Sample.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/11_Sample.md)** & **[01_Untitled.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/01_Untitled.md)**\n    - Seed records and testing entries.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Database Schema Overview\n\n| Collection Name | Primary Property | Properties / Schema Columns |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **My Adminnotes** | `Name` (title) | `Tags` (multi_select), `Date` (date), `Checkbox` (checkbox), `URL` (url) |\n| **Mynotes** | `Name` (title) | `Tags` (multi_select), `Date` (date), `Checkbox` (checkbox), `URL` (url) |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Local File Mapping\n\nAll files are stored locally in your workspace for immediate offline reading, editing, and search:\n- Index: [scratch/my_notes/INDEX.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/INDEX.md)\n- Root Page: [00_My_Notes_Main.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/scratch/my_notes/00_My_Notes_Main.md)\n- Mirror Copy: [my_notes/INDEX.md](file:///c:/Users/adity/Ag%20Folder/my_notes/INDEX.md)\n",
